  "solution": "The pattern followed here is:\n\n**( 1st Number × 2nd Number ) × 2 = 3rd Number**\n\n__\n \n• ​(15, 5, 150)\n\n ⇒ **(****15 × 5**__**)** × 2 = 150\n\n ⇒ 75 × 2 = 150\n\n ⇒ **150 = 150**\n\n__\n \n• (16, 4, 128)\n\n ⇒ **(****16 × 4**__**)** × 2 = 128\n\n ⇒ 64 × 2 = 128\n\n ⇒ **128 = 128**\n\n__\n \n• (7, 7, 98)\n\n ⇒ **(7 × 7__)** × 2 = 98\n\n ⇒ 49 × 2 = 98\n\n ⇒ **98 = 98**\n\n__\n \n• **(11, 4, ?)**\n\n** ⇒ (11 × 4__) **× 2 = ?\n\n ⇒ 44 × 2 = ?\n\n ⇒ **88**\n\nThe number that can replace the question mark is **'88'**\n\nHence, the correct answer is '**88'**",
